---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service — Whatever is Lovely">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-semibold uppercase text-terra">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">Last updated: November 2026 · Demo terms for the client presentation — replace with real legal text before launch.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">About this website</h2>
      <p>This website presents the wedding planning services of Whatever is Lovely, a Kansas City studio. All content on this site — including photographs, prices and couple stories in this demo — is provided for presentation purposes and may change before launch.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">Enquiries</h2>
      <p>Sending an enquiry through the Work With Us form does not create a booking. A booking is confirmed only when we agree it in writing and any deposit is received.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">Services and prices</h2>
      <p>Service descriptions and starting prices on this site are indicative. Your final quote is fixed in writing before work begins, and that written quote is what applies.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-terra">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Email hello@whateverislovely.com and we will be happy to help.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
